# Route: guide 36 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 56, 23 quests, 1.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thousand Needles, Western Plaguelands, Tirisfal Glades): Camp E'thok
# -> Freewind Post -> Darkcloud Pinnacle -> Camp E'thok -> Freewind Post ->
# Windbreak Canyon -> The Shimmering Flats -> Northridge Lumber Camp ->
# Felstone Field -> Ruins of Andorhal -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> The
# Bulwark.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Encrusted Tail Fins (1107;
# Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37,
# Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); A Host of Evil (6626;
# Razorfen Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist
# 33-34).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Gahz'rilla (2770), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher
# (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466),
# Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus
# Illusions (6569), Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288).

